  "rating": {
    "inherent": "moderate",
    "residual": "low",
    "forecast": "moderate",
    "rationale": "Manual validation applied against the checklist because scripts could not be run. Present design evidence shows a narrow A3 agent with one read-only internal search capability and one reply channel bound to the authenticated requester. The highest present inherent risk is moderate from trusted employee input reaching an irreversible internal reply, but residual drops to low because structural controls constrain destinations and verified network egress denial severs broader outbound exfiltration paths. Forecast rises to moderate if those structural constraints are removed, if new outbound tools are added, or if searchable data scope expands beyond curated published policies."
  },
